          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP347 - Edmonton CITO

This might be my only &quot;event&quot; cap. Like the last finder, I quickly saw the sticks and flags making more an easy locate. A little spit and the numbers were readable. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

