        <groundspeak:log id="682474956">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-29T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="4853503">gumbyphv</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;I found BCP347 Edmonton CITO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was a busy place and it was pretty tough to find parking, once I did I headed straight over to this cap.  Thanks to the nearby construction this cap is marked with three laths attached together with some flagging.  It definitely makes this one easy to find.  Thanks for another nice cap.  TFTBC  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="651867143">
