          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="7458582">mkPerry</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP347 - Edmonton CITO

Stopped by on the way home. Weekday caching is now pretty much in the dark but this was pretty easy to find even though the nearby construction traffic seems to have churned the ground up pretty well. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
