          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="578246">BVPete</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP347 Edmonton CITO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mrs BVPete, Jack and I walked from the Muttart Conservatory's parking area across the pedestrian bridge and along the sidewalk to GZ where the cap was clearly visible standing about an inch above the ground.  The photos were taken and we walked back over the bridge to access the cap located on the other side of the conservatory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap ofth&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
